              <div class="gov-marker-point sm"></div>
            </div>
            Core reachability assumptions
          </li>
          <li class="gov-content-list-item">
            <div class="gov-marker sm">
              <div class="gov-marker-point sm"></div>
            </div>
            Security and routing requirements
